#: src/postulo/templates/help/install.html
msgid "<strong>Chrome, Edge, Brave and other browsers built on Chromium:</strong> the account menu offers <em>Install</em> where the browser allows it. The browser's own menu has the same entry, and on a computer so does the icon at the end of the address bar."
msgstr "<strong>Chrome, Edge, Brave an aner Browser op Basis vu Chromium:</strong> de Kontmenü bitt <em>Installéieren</em> un, wou de Browser et erlaabt. Dem Browser säin eegene Menü huet deeselwechte Punkt, an op engem Computer och d'Ikon um Enn vun der Adressläischt."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/install.html
msgid "<strong>Firefox on Android:</strong> choose <em>Add to Home screen</em> from the browser's menu. Firefox on Windows, from version 143, adds a site to the taskbar from the web apps button in the address bar. Firefox on other computers does not install sites as apps; open this site in one of the browsers above."
msgstr ""

#: src/postulo/templates/help/install.html
msgid "<strong>Safari on a Mac:</strong> choose <em>Add to Dock</em> from the <em>File</em> menu, or from the Share button."
msgstr "<strong>Safari op engem Mac:</strong> wielt <em>Add to Dock</em> aus dem Menü <em>File</em>, oder iwwer d'Deelen-Knäppchen."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/install.html
msgid "<strong>Safari on an iPhone or iPad:</strong> press the Share button, then <em>Add to Home Screen</em>."
msgstr "<strong>Safari op engem iPhone oder iPad:</strong> dréckt op d'Deelen-Knäppchen, dann op <em>Add to Home Screen</em>."

