msgstr "E CV fänkt mat enger Karriär un, e Portfolio mat Aarbechten. Dovun hänkt of, wéi eng Designen hei ënnendrënner ugebuede ginn."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/documents.html
msgid "A CV or a letter can be downloaded as the formats this instance offers, previewed beside its controls, and compared with an earlier version that was sent."
msgstr "E CV oder e Bréif ka an de Formater erofgeluede ginn, déi dës Instanz ubitt, nieft senge Bedéngelementer an der Virschau gewise ginn, a mat enger fréierer Versioun, déi geschéckt gouf, verglach ginn."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/cv_photo.html
msgid "A CV photo is a photograph for your CVs, kept apart from your picture above: the picture stands for you on these pages, and the CV photo is only ever printed on a CV."
msgstr "Eng CV-Foto ass eng Foto fir Är CVen, getrennt vun Ärem Bild uewen: d'Bild steet op dëse Säite fir Iech, an d'CV-Foto gëtt nëmmen op engem CV gedréckt."

#: src/postulo/templates/accounts/profile.html
msgid "A CV photo is kept."
msgstr "Eng CV-Foto ass gespäichert."

#: src/postulo/templates/resume/overview.html
msgid "A CV prints a skill under its group. Open one to choose it."
msgstr "E CV weist eng Kompetenz ënner hirer Kompetenzgrupp. Maacht eng op, fir se ze wielen."

#: src/postulo/resume/forms.py
msgid "A CV prints only the year, so the day makes no difference."
msgstr "E CV weist nëmmen d'Joer, dofir mécht den Dag keen Ënnerscheed."

#: src/postulo/resume/forms.py
msgid "A CV prints the month and the year, so the day makes no difference."
msgstr "E CV weist nëmmen de Mount an d'Joer, dofir mécht den Dag keen Ënnerscheed."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/cv_photo.html
msgid "A CV prints the photo only when you tick that on the CV. The plain text and the Word file never carry it. Tick <em>Remove the CV photo</em> and save to take it away."
msgstr "E CV dréckt d'Foto nëmmen, wann Dir dat um CV uhaakt. Den einfachen Text an de Word-Fichier enthalen se ni. Haakt <em>CV-Foto ewechhuelen</em> un a späichert, fir se ewechzehuelen."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/identifiers.html
msgid "A CV prints your identifiers in its contact block: all of them, the ones you tick for it, or none, as its own <em>Settings</em> say. The bin removes a row at once, after asking, and its kind can then be chosen again."
msgstr "E CV weist Är Identifikateuren a sengem Kontaktblock: all, déi, déi Dir dofir uhaakt, oder keng, esou wéi seng eege <em>Astellungen</em> et soen. D'Poubelle hëlt eng Zeil direkt ewech, nodeems se gefrot huet, an hir Zort ka dann nees gewielt ginn."

#: src/postulo/core/gdpr.py
msgid "A CV that was already sent keeps them, as it was sent."
msgstr "E CV, dee scho geschéckt gouf, behält se, esou wéi e geschéckt gouf."

