msgstr "E Fichier, deen de Postulo selwer geschriwwen huet, gëtt op enger eegener Säit gelies."

#: src/postulo/templates/core/kind_file.html
#, python-format
msgid "A file this page made, here or on another Postulo, of up to %(size)s MB and %(most)s records. You are shown what is in it, and what adding it would do, before anything is added."
msgstr "E Fichier, deen dës Säit gemaach huet, hei oder op engem anere Postulo, vu bis zu %(size)s MB an %(most)s Andréi. Dir gesitt, wat drasteet a wat d'Derbäisetzen dovu géif maachen, ier eppes derbäigesat gëtt."

#: src/postulo/templates/resume/candidate_file.html
msgid "A file this page made, here or on another Postulo. You are shown what is in it, and what adding it would do, before anything is added."
msgstr "E Fichier, deen dës Säit gemaach huet, hei oder op engem anere Postulo. Iech gëtt gewisen, wat dran ass a wat d'Derbäisetze géif maachen, ier eppes derbäigesat gëtt."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/your_name.html
msgid "A form of address is what is written before a name, and pronouns say how to refer to you. Nothing is assumed when either is blank, and neither is ever worked out from your name."
msgstr "En Uried ass dat, wat virun en Numm geschriwwe gëtt, a Pronomen soen, wéi iwwer Iech geschwat gëtt. Näischt gëtt ugeholl, wann eent dovun eidel ass, a keent gëtt jee aus Ärem Numm ofgeleet."

#: src/postulo/core/help.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "A form of address is written before your name, and your pronouns say how to refer to you. Both are optional, nothing is assumed when they are blank, and each is kept as a choice that your pages and documents show in their own language."
msgstr "Eng Uriedform gëtt virun Äre Numm geschriwwen, an Är Pronomen soen, wéi een iwwer Iech schwätze soll. Béid sinn optional, näischt gëtt ugeholl, wa se eidel sinn, an all eenzelt gëtt als Wiel behalen, dat Är Säiten an Dokumenter an hirer eegener Sprooch weisen."

#: src/postulo/core/views_access.py
