#: src/postulo/templates/settings/accessibility.html
#, python-format
msgid "Postulo is checked against WCAG 2.2 at level AA, in both themes, at 320 pixels and under Windows High Contrast; reduced motion and more contrast follow your system's own setting. What is checked, what is known not to work yet, and how to tell us when something does not work for you is on the <a href=\"%(guide)s\" class=\"underline\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer external\" target=\"_blank\">Accessibility page<span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>."
msgstr "De Postulo gëtt no WCAG 2.2 um Niveau AA gepréift, a béiden Designen, bei 320 Pixel an ënner Windows High Contrast; reduzéiert Beweegung a méi Kontrast follegen der eegener Astellung vun Ärem System. Wat gepréift gëtt, wat bekanntlech nach net funktionéiert, a wéi Dir eis sot, wann eppes fir Iech net funktionéiert, steet op der <a href=\"%(guide)s\" class=\"underline\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer external\" target=\"_blank\">Säit iwwer d'Accessibilitéit<span class=\"sr-only\"> (geet an engem neien Tab op)</span></a>."

