msgstr "Wéini den Aarbechtgeber se publizéiert huet, wann d'Annonce et seet. Eidel heescht onbekannt."

#: src/postulo/applications/forms.py
msgid "When you actually sent it. Left empty it is today, which is wrong for a search already under way — and reply times, the months and the report are measured from this date."
msgstr "Wéini Dir se wierklech geschéckt hutt. Eidel gelooss ass et haut, wat fir eng Sich, déi scho leeft, falsch ass — an d'Äntwertzäiten, d'Méint an de Rapport gi vun dësem Datum aus gemooss."

#: src/postulo/templates/settings/capture.html
msgid "When you correct a field on review and the value you typed is on the page, where it was is remembered for that site, and your next capture from it is read there first. Yours alone, and in your export. A place that is wrong twice in a row is forgotten by itself."
msgstr "Wann Dir bei der Iwwerpréiwung e Feld korrigéiert an de Wäert, deen Dir agetippt hutt, op der Säit steet, gëtt fir dee Site gemierkt, wou e stoung, an Är nächst Erfaassung vun do gëtt fir d'éischt do gelies. Nëmmen Är, an an Ärem Export. Eng Plaz, déi zweemol hannereneen falsch ass, gëtt vu sech aus vergiess."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/email.html
msgid "When you register this instance with the provider, give it this address to send people back to:"
msgstr "Wann Dir dës Instanz beim Ubidder registréiert, gitt him dës Adress, op déi d'Leit zréckgeschéckt ginn:"

#: src/postulo/applications/models.py
msgid "where"
msgstr "wou"

#: src/postulo/templates/help/links.html
msgid "Where a card has a <em>Service</em> menu, choose the service the address is on. Its icon is shown beside it, and the address is checked against what an address on that service looks like, so a mistyped one is refused, and the refusal says why. Paste an address without choosing a service, and saving chooses it where the address is on one Postulo knows."
msgstr "Wou eng Kaart e Menü <em>Déngscht</em> huet, wielt den Déngscht, op deem d'Adress ass. Seng Ikon gëtt dernieft gewisen, an d'Adress gëtt mat deem verglach, wéi eng Adress op deem Déngscht ausgesäit, sou datt eng falsch agetippte ofgeleent gëtt, an d'Oflehnung seet firwat. Fügt eng Adress an, ouni en Déngscht ze wielen, an d'Späichere wielt en, wann d'Adress op engem ass, deen de Postulo kennt."

#: src/postulo/templates/cotton/identifier_schemes.html
msgid "Where a value leads: an http or https address with <code dir=\"ltr\">{value}</code> where the identifier goes, after the host. <code dir=\"ltr\">person_link</code> is the address for a person, where that is another one."
msgstr "Wouhi e Wäert féiert: eng http- oder https-Adress mat <code dir=\"ltr\">{value}</code> do, wou den Identifikateur higehéiert, nom Host. <code dir=\"ltr\">person_link</code> ass d'Adress fir eng Persoun, wann déi eng aner ass."

#: src/postulo/applications/widgets.py
msgid "Where and why applications end"
msgstr "Wou a firwat Kandidaturen ophalen"

#: src/postulo/resume/forms.py
msgid "Where it can be read about. A CV does not print it."
msgstr "Wou ee méi doriwwer liese kann. E CV weist et net."

#: src/postulo/resume/forms.py
msgid "Where it can be read, where it has no DOI."
msgstr "Wou et ze liesen ass, wann et keen DOI huet."

#: src/postulo/resume/forms.py
msgid "Where it can be seen. A CV prints it beside the name."
msgstr "Wou et ze gesinn ass. E CV weist et nieft dem Numm."

#: src/postulo/templates/jobs/company_wikidata.html
#, fuzzy
msgid "Where it is"
msgstr "Wou se ass"

#: src/postulo/resume/forms.py
msgid "Where it was published, or the conference's city."
msgstr "Wou et verëffentlecht gouf, oder d'Stad vun der Konferenz."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/plugins.html
msgid "Where plugins may come from"
msgstr "Vu wou Plugins kommen dierfen"

#: src/postulo/accounts/forms.py
msgid "Where Postulo writes to you, and what a CV prints if you let it show contact details."
msgstr "Wou de Postulo Iech schreift, a wat e CV weist, wann Dir him erlaabt, Kontaktdaten ze weisen."

