msgstr "Wikidata konnt net erreecht ginn."

#: src/postulo/jobs/views.py
msgid "Wikidata gives its name in that language. Fetch again to change it, or take it off first."
msgstr "Wikidata gëtt säin Numm an där Sprooch un. Ruft nach eng Kéier of, fir en z'änneren, oder huelt en fir d'éischt ewech."

#: src/postulo/jobs/wikidata.py
msgid "Wikidata has no item with that identifier."
msgstr "Wikidata huet keen Element mat deem Identifikateur."

#: src/postulo/templates/jobs/company_wikidata.html
#, python-format
msgid "Wikidata names %(qid)s as its replacement; no company here carries that identifier."
msgstr "Wikidata nennt %(qid)s als säin Ersatz; keng Firma hei huet dësen Identifikateur."

#: src/postulo/jobs/wikidata.py
msgid "Wikidata redirected too many times."
msgstr "Wikidata huet ze dacks ëmgeleet."

#: src/postulo/templates/jobs/company_wikidata.html
msgid "Wikidata says this organisation has ended. Choose whether to record it; the legal state is shown to everybody who can see this company."
msgstr "Wikidata seet, datt dës Organisatioun opgehalen huet. Wielt, ob Dir dat notéiere wëllt; de rechtleche Statut gëtt jidderengem gewisen, deen dës Firma gesäit."

#: src/postulo/jobs/wikidata.py
msgid "Wikidata sent the request somewhere else."
msgstr "Wikidata huet d'Ufro anzwousch anescht higeschéckt."

#: src/postulo/jobs/wikidata.py
msgid "Wikidata took too long to answer."
msgstr "Wikidata huet ze laang gebraucht, fir z'äntweren."

#: src/postulo/jobs/wikidata.py
msgid "Wikidata's answer was larger than an item should be."
msgstr "D'Äntwert vu Wikidata war méi grouss wéi en Element si soll."

#: src/postulo/jobs/wikidata.py
msgid "Wikidata's answer was not an item."
msgstr "D'Äntwert vu Wikidata war keen Element."

#: src/postulo/templates/jobs/company_wikidata.html
msgid "Wikidata's data is in the public domain (CC0). Keeping these replaces any name you typed for the same language, and takes off a name an earlier fetch gave that this one did not."
msgstr "D'Donnéeë vu Wikidata sinn am ëffentlechen Domän (CC0). Wann Dir dës behaalt, ersetze se all Numm, deen Dir fir déiselwecht Sprooch agetippt hutt, an huelen en Numm ewech, deen e fréieren Ofruff ginn huet an dësen net."

#: src/postulo/core/file_review.py
msgid "Will be added"
msgstr "Gëtt derbäigesat"

#: src/postulo/templates/settings/account.html
msgid "With a passkey: no code. The passkey is both factors already."
msgstr "Mat engem Zougangsschlëssel: kee Code. De Schlëssel ass scho béid Faktoren."

#: src/postulo/templates/settings/account.html
msgid "With a password: you are asked for your second factor every time."
msgstr "Mat Passwuert: Dir gitt all Kéier no Ärem zweete Faktor gefrot."

#: src/postulo/templates/settings/account.html
#, python-format
msgid "With a password: you are asked for your second factor, unless you marked this browser as trusted. That lasts %(days)s day."
msgid_plural "With a password: you are asked for your second factor, unless you marked this browser as trusted. That lasts %(days)s days."
msgstr[0] "Mat Passwuert: Dir gitt no Ärem zweete Faktor gefrot, ausser Dir hutt dëse Browser als vertrauenswierdeg markéiert. Dat hält %(days)s Dag."
msgstr[1] "Mat Passwuert: Dir gitt no Ärem zweete Faktor gefrot, ausser Dir hutt dëse Browser als vertrauenswierdeg markéiert. Dat hält %(days)s Deeg."

