msgstr "Mat enger Persoun"

#: src/postulo/templates/server/backup_restore.html
msgid "With Docker Compose"
msgstr "Mat Docker Compose"

#: src/postulo/templates/jobs/share.html
msgid "With one of your groups"
msgstr "Mat engem vun Äre Gruppen"

#: src/postulo/templates/core/kind_file.html
msgid "With the company each is at, by name, and every way of reaching them."
msgstr "Mat der Firma vun all Persoun, mam Numm, an alle Weeër, fir se z'erreechen."

#: src/postulo/templates/core/kind_file.html
msgid "With the company of each, by name. What happened to a listing, and what was captured from its page, is left out."
msgstr "Mat der Firma vun all Annonce, mam Numm. Wat mat enger Annonce geschitt ass, a wat vun hirer Säit erfaasst gouf, bleift ewech."

#: src/postulo/templates/core/kind_file.html
msgid "With the listing of each, its company by name, its timeline and its interviews. Reminders, offers and the files an application went out with are left out, because a JSON file cannot carry a file."
msgstr "Mat der Annonce vun all Kandidatur, hirer Firma mam Numm, hirer Zäitlinn an hiren Entretienen. Erënnerungen, Offeren an d'Fichieren, mat deenen eng Kandidatur fortgaangen ass, bleiwen ewech, well e JSON-Fichier kee Fichier droe kann."

